      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Bớt chút được không? is the compact local-feeling way to ask for a little lower price. It is useful in markets, informal stalls, or flexible-price moments where the seller expects some back-and-forth.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
    {
      "id": "breakdown",
      "title": "Break it down",
      "body": "This pattern asks for a yes-or-no answer. Keep the main need together so the question feels natural.",
